---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: Legion operator calls transferInvestorPosition(from, to)
    q_check_auth --> q_error_auth: caller is not Legion operator
    q_error_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_from: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_from --> q_error_from: position[from].investedCapital == 0
    q_error_from --> [*]: revert NoPosition
    q_check_from --> q_check_to: position[from] exists
    q_check_to --> q_error_to: position[to].investedCapital > 0
    q_error_to --> [*]: revert PositionAlreadyExists
    q_check_to --> q_transfer_pos: position[to] is empty
    q_transfer_pos --> q_clear_old: position[to] = position[from]
    q_clear_old --> q_emit: delete position[from]
    q_emit --> [*]: emit InvestorPositionTransferred(from, to)

    note right of q_transfer_pos
        INV-001: Position transfer preserves all position data (invested, claimed, vesting)
        INV-002: Target address must not have an existing position
        INV-003: Source position is fully cleared after transfer
    end note
